<section id="about" class="section-pad bg-stone-100 py-4 md:py-24 lg:py-8 h-max lg:h-dvh">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-4 md:gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20 w-full h-full">
    <div data-reveal class="order-2 lg:order-1 h-full lg:max-h-[600px] 2xl:max-h-[900px] flex flex-col md:justify-center items-center ">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow ">About</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl leading-tight text-ink">
          Light is the only language I trust completely.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-2 md:mt-4 space-y-2.5 xl:space-y-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/70 flex flex-col">
        <p>
          I grew up in a small print shop, watching my father coax color out
          of stubborn negatives long after everyone else had gone digital.
          That patience never left me. Today my work moves between
          documentary reportage, editorial portraiture and quiet landscape
          studies &mdash; always shot on location, always in available light.
        </p>
        <p>
          My clients range from international magazines and heritage brands
          to couples who want their wedding told like a short story rather
          than a checklist of poses. Whatever the brief, the approach stays
          the same: get close, wait for the honest moment, and only press
          the shutter when the light agrees.
        </p>
        <p>
          Based between Lisbon and wherever the next assignment happens to
          be, I&rsquo;m usually booked two to three months out &mdash; but I
          always make room for projects I believe in.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class=" mt-4 2xl:mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-1 md:gap-3">
        {['Portraiture', 'Documentary', 'Architecture', 'Travel Editorial'].map((tag) => (
          <span class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 px-2 py-1 md:px-4 md:py-2 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-widest2 text-ink/60">
            {tag}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="order-1 [perspective:1000px] lg:order-2 w-full max-h-[900px]">
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] tilt-card">
        <img
          src="/images/about-photo.png"
          alt="Julian Voss on location, camera in hand, overlooking a valley"
          class="mx-auto object-cover w-full aspect-auto md:aspect-[3/5] xl:aspect-auto max-h-[600px] 2xl:max-h-[900px]"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-2 md:left-5 rounded-xl bg-ink/70 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest2 text-stone-100 backdrop-blur-sm">
          On assignment &mdash; Georgia
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
